---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page
  title="闪卡词典 FlashDict — 查到的词，留在你的记忆里。"
  description="闪卡词典 FlashDict，把本地词典、义项制卡与间隔复习连在一起。在 Mac、iPhone 和 iPad 上，让每一次查词有所积累。"
  ogTitle="闪卡词典 — 查到的词，留在你的记忆里。"
  ogDescription="导入本地词典，留下需要的义项，用间隔复习慢慢记住。适用于 Mac、iPhone 与 iPad。"
>
<main id="main">
    <section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span class="little-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span> 本地词典 × 间隔复习</div>
      <h1 id="hero-title">查到的词，<br><span>留在你的记忆里。</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">你的本地词典，也是你的闪卡库。<br>查词时留下需要的义项，用间隔复习慢慢记住。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="#download">获取闪卡词典 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="button button-quiet" href="#features">体验义项制卡 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="platform-caption">为 Mac、iPhone 与 iPad 而设计</p>
    </section>

    <section class="experience wrap" id="experience" aria-label="产品界面演示">
      <div class="experience-footer"><div class="product-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="切换产品界面"><button id="tab-lookup" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="panel-lookup" tabindex="0"><span>01</span> 查词</button><button id="tab-review" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-review" tabindex="-1"><span>02</span> 复习</button><button id="tab-library" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="panel-library" tabindex="-1"><span>03</span> 词典</button></div><span class="placeholder-note" id="screenshot-note">界面示意 · 非实际截图</span></div>
      <div class="product-stage">
        <div class="stage-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="window">
          <div class="window-bar"><span class="traffic-lights" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>FlashDict</span><span class="window-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◫</span></div>
          <div class="product-panel" id="panel-lookup" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-lookup" tabindex="0" data-screenshot="lookup">
            <div class="lookup-mock mock-content" role="group" aria-label="查词界面示意：左侧导航，中间查词历史，右侧释义与义项制卡入口。">
              <aside class="mock-sidebar"><div class="mock-brand"><img src="/assets/app-icon.png" width="23" height="23" alt="">闪卡词典</div><div class="sidebar-item selected"><span>⌕</span> 查词</div><div class="sidebar-item"><span>◷</span> 复习</div><div class="sidebar-item"><span>▤</span> 闪卡</div><div class="sidebar-rule"></div><div class="sidebar-label">我的内容</div><div class="sidebar-item"><span>▥</span> 词典管理</div><div class="sidebar-item"><span>↶</span> 查词历史</div><div class="sidebar-bottom">⚙ <span>设置</span></div></aside>
              <div class="mock-results"><div class="mock-search"><span>⌕</span> serendipity <kbd>↵</kbd></div><div class="sidebar-label">最近查询</div><div class="result-row active"><strong>serendipity</strong><span>意外发现美好事物的运气</span></div><div class="result-row"><strong>resonance</strong><span>共鸣；共振</span></div><div class="result-row"><strong>ephemeral</strong><span>短暂的；转瞬即逝的</span></div><div class="result-row"><strong>curiosity</strong><span>好奇心；求知欲</span></div><div class="result-row"><strong>perspective</strong><span>观点；视角</span></div><div class="result-footer">自己的词典，熟悉的释义。</div></div>
              <div class="mock-definition"><div class="definition-toolbar"><span>‹ &nbsp; ›</span><span>词典释义</span><span>☆ &nbsp; ···</span></div><div class="definition-body"><div class="dictionary-tag">示例词典 <span>英汉</span></div><h2>serendipity</h2><div class="phonetic">/ˌser.ənˈdɪp.ə.ti/ <span class="audio-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◖))</span></div><div class="sense"><div class="sense-heading"><span><i>noun</i> &nbsp; 不可数名词</span><a class="sense-add" href="#features" aria-label="体验从义项生成闪卡">+</a></div><p class="definition-en">Finding something wonderful<br>when you weren't looking for it.</p><p class="definition-zh">意外发现美好事物的运气；机缘巧合</p><div class="example"><p>A little curiosity can lead to serendipity.</p><p>一点好奇心，也许就能带来意外之喜。</p></div></div><div class="inline-tip"><span>✦</span> 选择一个义项，把这次发现留在闪卡里。</div></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="product-panel" id="panel-review" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-review" tabindex="0" data-screenshot="review" hidden>
            <div class="review-mock mock-content"><div class="review-top"><span>专注复习</span><span>闪卡演示</span><span>FSRS</span></div><div class="review-progress"><span></span></div><div class="review-face"><span class="overline">先回忆，再看答案</span><h2>serendipity</h2><p class="review-prompt">还记得这个词的意思吗？</p><div id="review-answer" hidden><p>意外发现美好事物的运气；机缘巧合</p><span>A little curiosity can lead to serendipity.</span></div></div><button class="button button-primary" id="reveal-answer" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="review-answer">显示答案 <span aria-hidden="true">↵</span></button><div class="review-ratings" id="review-ratings" aria-label="为示例闪卡评分" hidden>
              <button data-rating="忘记">忘记</button><button data-rating="困难">困难</button><button data-rating="记得">记得</button><button data-rating="轻松">轻松</button>
            </div><p class="review-note" id="review-feedback" role="status">交互示意 · 先回忆，再显示答案并评分。</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="product-panel" id="panel-library" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-library" tabindex="0" data-screenshot="library" hidden>
            <div class="library-mock mock-content" role="img" aria-label="词典管理界面示意：导入本地 MDX 文件、管理词典顺序与启用状态。"><div class="library-heading"><div><span class="overline">YOUR WORDS. YOUR DICTIONARIES.</span><h2>你的词典，悉数在场。</h2></div><span class="mock-import">+ 导入词典</span></div><div class="library-row"><span class="book-icon blue">Aa</span><div><strong>我的英汉词典</strong><span>本地 MDX · 英汉释义</span></div><span class="library-state">已启用</span></div><div class="library-row"><span class="book-icon amber">En</span><div><strong>我的英语词典</strong><span>本地 MDX · 英英释义</span></div><span class="library-state">已启用</span></div><div class="library-row"><span class="book-icon gray">文</span><div><strong>我的专业词典</strong><span>本地 MDX · 专业词汇</span></div><span class="library-state muted">未启用</span></div><p class="library-note">导入你已有的词典。按习惯排序，按需要启用。</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="workflow wrap" aria-label="从查词到复习">
      <article><span class="feature-number">01 / 查词</span><h2>从自己的词典开始</h2><p>导入 MDX 词典，在不同释义之间参照，找到当前语境里的意思。</p></article>
      <article><span class="feature-number">02 / 制卡</span><h2>留下这次需要的义项</h2><p>将支持提取的义项变成精简闪卡，也可以为整个词条创建词典闪卡。</p></article>
      <article><span class="feature-number">03 / 复习</span><h2>把下一次相遇交给 FSRS</h2><p>先回忆，再看答案并评分。根据每次反馈，安排卡片的下一次复习。</p></article>
    </section>

    <section class="detail-section wrap" id="features" aria-labelledby="detail-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><div class="section-kicker"><span>01</span> 记住具体的意思</div><h2 id="detail-title">一个词有很多意思。<br><span class="muted">这次，只留下需要的那个。</span></h2></div>
        <p>点一下释义旁的「+」，把这个义项和例句留在闪卡上。复习时，专注于当时想记住的内容。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="sense-demo" aria-label="义项制卡交互示意">
        <div class="sense-source">
          <div class="demo-label"><span>词典中的义项</span><span>示例词典 · 英汉</span></div>
          <h3>resonate <span>verb</span></h3><p class="demo-phonetic">/ˈrez.ə.neɪt/</p>
          <div class="sense-option" data-sense="01">
            <div class="sense-option-heading"><span class="sense-index">01</span><strong class="sense-meaning">发出共鸣；回响</strong><button class="sense-select" aria-label="将义项 01 发出共鸣、回响生成示例闪卡" aria-pressed="false"><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div>
            <p class="sense-example-en">Her voice resonated through the room.</p><p class="sense-example-zh">她的声音在房间里回响。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sense-option" data-sense="02">
            <div class="sense-option-heading"><span class="sense-index">02</span><strong class="sense-meaning">引起共鸣；产生共感</strong><button class="sense-select" aria-label="将义项 02 引起共鸣、产生共感生成示例闪卡" aria-pressed="false"><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div>
            <p class="sense-example-en">That story still resonates with me.</p><p class="sense-example-zh">那个故事至今仍让我产生共鸣。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="sense-connector" aria-hidden="true"><span>→</span></div>
        <div class="sense-destination" id="sense-destination">
          <div class="demo-label"><span>你的义项闪卡</span><span class="card-state" id="card-state">等待选择</span></div>
          <div class="card-empty" id="card-empty"><span class="empty-card-symbol" aria-hidden="true">+</span><h3>从一个意思开始。</h3><p>点击任意义项旁的「+」<br>看看它会留下什么。</p></div>
          <div class="generated-card" id="generated-card" hidden><span class="generated-label">义项 <span id="generated-index"></span></span><h3>resonate <span>verb</span></h3><p id="generated-meaning"></p><blockquote><p id="generated-example-en"></p><p id="generated-example-zh"></p></blockquote><div class="generated-footer"><span>释义与例句，放在一起。</span><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="demo-footer"><p id="sense-feedback" role="status">试试看：选择一个义项，生成你的示例闪卡。</p><span>交互示意 · 不会保存到 App</span></div>
      <div class="detail-footnote"><span aria-hidden="true">☆</span><p>想保留整个词条？创建词典闪卡，复习时查阅对应词典。义项制卡需要词典已有提取适配。</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="devices-section wrap" id="devices" aria-labelledby="devices-title">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>02</span> 在不同设备上接着学</div>
      <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="devices-title">桌前查得深入。<br><span class="muted">出门也能接着复习。</span></h2><p>用 Mac 阅读和整理，用 iPhone 的片刻时间复习。你的词汇积累，跟着你走。</p></div>
      <div class="devices-grid">
        <div class="device-details"><div class="device-feature"><span class="device-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span><div><h3>Mac 上的专注空间</h3><p>分栏查词、键盘快捷操作、独立复习窗口。适合阅读、整理和沉浸学习。</p><span class="system-label">macOS 14 及以上</span></div></div><div class="device-feature"><span class="device-icon" aria-hidden="true">◫</span><div><h3>iPhone 与 iPad 上的随身词典</h3><p>iPhone 上轻松查词与复习，iPad 上利用分栏展开词典内容。</p><span class="system-label">iOS / iPadOS 17 及以上</span></div></div><div class="sync-note"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 17H5a4 4 0 0 1-.6-8A7 7 0 0 1 18 7a5 5 0 0 1 1 10h-1M8 17l4 4 4-4M12 21V11"/></svg><div><h3>闪卡与复习进度，通过 iCloud 同步。</h3><p>词典文件、图片和音频不随 iCloud 同步。请在各设备添加对应词典。</p></div></div></div>
        <figure class="mobile-showcase"><div class="mobile-frame" data-screenshot="mobile"><div class="mobile-mock mock-content" role="img" aria-label="iPhone 复习界面示意：今日复习概览与 serendipity 闪卡。"><div class="mobile-status"><span>9:41</span><span>▮▮▮ &nbsp; ▰</span></div><div class="mobile-title"><span>复习</span><span aria-hidden="true">···</span></div><div class="mobile-greeting">今天的几分钟，<br>留给值得记住的词。</div><div class="mobile-section-label">闪卡预览</div><div class="mobile-card"><span>义项闪卡</span><h3>serendipity</h3><p>/ˌser.ənˈdɪp.ə.ti/</p><div class="mobile-card-rule"></div><div>意外发现美好事物的运气；<br>机缘巧合</div><p class="mobile-example">A little curiosity can<br>lead to serendipity.</p></div><div class="mobile-study">开始复习 <span>→</span></div><div class="mobile-tabbar"><span>⌕<small>查词</small></span><span class="active">◷<small>复习</small></span><span>▤<small>管理</small></span></div><div class="home-indicator"></div></div></div><figcaption>iPhone 界面示意 · 非实际截图</figcaption></figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="essentials wrap" aria-label="更多功能"><div class="essential-item"><span class="essential-icon" aria-hidden="true">↙</span><h3>本地词典，离线可查。</h3><p>准备好词典和资源后，即使没有网络，也能继续查阅本地词条。</p></div><div class="essential-item"><span class="essential-icon" aria-hidden="true">文<span>A</span></span><h3>需要时，多一份翻译。</h3><p>Apple 系统翻译，以及可自行配置的 DeepL、OpenAI 兼容服务。</p></div><div class="essential-item"><span class="essential-icon" aria-hidden="true">⇄</span><h3>积累的内容，自由带走。</h3><p>以 FlashDict JSON 格式导入、导出闪卡，为自己的词汇积累保留副本。</p></div></section>

    <section class="faq-section wrap" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div><div class="section-kicker"><span>03</span> 开始使用</div><h2 id="faq-title">准备好你的词典。<br><span class="muted">剩下的，从这里了解。</span></h2><a class="text-link" href="/support">查看使用支持 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="faq-list">
      <details><summary>可以使用自己的词典吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>可以。闪卡词典支持导入本地 MDX 词典，并管理词典顺序和启用状态。如果词典有配套图片、音频等资源，请一并准备对应资源文件。示意图中的词典名称仅用于展示，不代表 App 附赠这些内容。</p></details>
      <details><summary>所有词典都支持按义项制卡吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>按义项生成精简闪卡，需要词典已有适配的义项提取支持。也可以通过“词典闪卡”收藏整个词条，在复习时查看对应词典内容。</p></details>
      <details><summary>闪卡如何安排复习？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>先尝试回忆，再显示答案，并根据记忆情况评分。App 使用 FSRS 调度，根据每张卡片的学习状态和评分，安排下一次复习。</p></details>
      <details><summary>哪些内容会同步到其他设备？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>开启 iCloud 同步后，闪卡与复习进度会在设备间同步。词典文件及图片、音频资源不包含在内；请在其他设备上添加对应词典。同步开关的调整在下次启动 App 后生效。</p></details>
      <details><summary>翻译需要联网或额外配置吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Apple 系统翻译需要 iOS 18 / macOS 15 或更新版本，语言支持和语言包由系统决定。DeepL 与 OpenAI 兼容服务需要自行配置、显式启用并联网使用；服务费用由相应服务商决定。</p></details>
      <details><summary>可以导入 Anki 卡片吗？<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>当前闪卡导入、导出使用 FlashDict 自己的 JSON 格式，并不直接支持 Anki 的 APKG 文件。FSRS 是复习调度算法，不代表与 Anki 文件格式互通。</p></details>
    </div></section>

    <section class="download-section wrap" id="download" aria-labelledby="download-title"><img src="/assets/app-icon.png" width="60" height="60" alt="" class="download-icon"><h2 id="download-title">从下一个好奇的词开始。</h2><p>带上你的词典，建立自己的闪卡库。</p><div class="download-links"><a class="download-link" data-download="mac" aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><span class="download-platform-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span><span><strong>Mac</strong><span>macOS 14+</span></span><span class="download-status">暂未开放</span></a><a class="download-link" data-download="ios" aria-disabled="true" tabindex="-1"><span class="download-platform-icon" aria-hidden="true">◫</span><span><strong>iPhone &amp; iPad</strong><span>iOS / iPadOS 17+</span></span><span class="download-status">暂未开放</span></a></div><p class="download-note" id="download-note">下载入口准备中。你可以先体验上方演示，或查看使用支持。</p></section>
  </main>
</Page>
